        "name": "Shehroz Kashif",
        "email": "131602772+Shehrozkashif@users.noreply.github.com",
        "date": "2025-08-18T07:50:48Z"
      },
      "message": "feat(generators): add schema validation with CI coverage\n\n- Added  function to enforce required schema fields\n- Integrated validation into backend generators to fail fast on schema changes\n- Improved error handling with explicit failure messages instead of silent exits\n- Added pytest-based tests (tests/test_schema_validator.py) for validation logic\n- Ensured CI runs these tests to automatically catch schema regressions\n\nFixes: #915",
